  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving national climate information services for enhancing climate resilience of rural communities in Peru</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening two existing and establishing one new government operated PGA, Developing strategies for information dissemination and communication systems and Building SENAMHIs technical and human capacity for climate observation</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to stabilize rural livelihoods and improve climate adaptation in Peru by delivering optimal climate information to vulnerable communities and establishing communication frameworks for resilience.&#xcee4;&#xbba4;&#xb2c8;&#xd2f0; &#xc911;&#xc2ec; &#xae30;&#xd6c4;&#xc815;&#xbcf4; &#xc11c;&#xbe44;&#xc2a4; &#xac15;&#xd654;, &#xae30;&#xd6c4; &#xc11c;&#xbe44;&#xc2a4; &#xd65c;&#xc131;&#xd654;&#xb97c; &#xc704;&#xd55c; &#xd398;&#xb8e8; &#xc218;&#xbb38;&#xae30;&#xc0c1;&#xccad; &#xacfc;&#xd559;&#xae30;&#xc220; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xac15;&#xd654;</narrative>
